<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>AVideoRouter — Zoom & Fathom recordings, auto-published to YouTube and your LMS</title>
  <meta name="description" content="VideoRouter automatically routes your Zoom and Fathom recordings to YouTube and your course platform — on a schedule, hands-free. Pay as you go, first upload free.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avr.divineleads.guru/">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "@id": "https://avr.divineleads.guru/#org",
        "name": "AVideoRouter",
        "url": "https://avr.divineleads.guru/",
        "email": "connect@divineleads.guru",
        "description": "AVideoRouter automatically moves Zoom and Fathom recordings to YouTube and your LMS, on a schedule, hands-free.",
        "parentOrganization": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Divine Leads" }
      },
      {
        "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
        "name": "AVideoRouter",
        "applicationCategory": "BusinessApplication",
        "operatingSystem": "Web",
        "url": "https://avr.divineleads.guru/",
        "description": "Automatically routes Zoom and Fathom recordings to YouTube and your LMS — download, upload, organize and optionally delete the Zoom original — on a schedule, hands-free.",
        "publisher": { "@id": "https://avr.divineleads.guru/#org" },
        "offers": {
          "@type": "Offer",
          "price": "50",
          "priceCurrency": "INR",
          "description": "Pay as you go — ₹50 per unit of transfer (up to 1 GB per file). First upload free. No subscription."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1420; --panel:#1a2233; --panel2:#223048; --line:#2e3d5c;
      --text:#e8edf7; --muted:#93a1bd; --accent:#4f8cff; --accent2:#7b5cff;
      --ok:#2ecc71;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
      font:16px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:var(--panel2);color:var(--text);cursor:pointer}
    .btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));border:none;color:#fff}
    .btn.big{padding:15px 30px;font-size:17px}

    header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(15,20,32,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    header .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:62px}
    .brand{font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.2px}
    .brand span{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}

    .hero{text-align:center;padding:70px 0 40px}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:800}
    .hero h1 .hl{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
    .hero p.sub{font-size:clamp(17px,2.2vw,21px);color:var(--muted);max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 28px}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .tiny{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:14px}

    .video{padding:10px 0 20px}
    .video-frame{position:relative;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;
      border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
    .video-frame iframe{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}

    .speed{margin:24px auto;max-width:900px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(79,140,255,.14),rgba(123,92,255,.14));
      border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px;display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;text-align:center}
    .speed b{font-size:22px}
    .speed .num{font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}

    section{padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
    section h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3.4vw,34px);margin:0 0 10px;text-align:center;font-weight:800}
    section .lead{color:var(--muted);text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 34px}

    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
    .step{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px}
    .step .n{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px}
    .step h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:18px}
    .step p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
    .feat{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px}
    .feat .ic{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:10px}
    .feat h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:17px}
    .feat p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}

    .price{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;text-align:center}
    .price .amt{font-size:44px;font-weight:800}
    .price .amt small{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
    .price ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0;text-align:left;display:inline-block}
    .price li{padding:7px 0;color:var(--text)}
    .price li::before{content:"✓";color:var(--ok);font-weight:800;margin-right:10px}
    .price-row{display:flex;gap:22px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch}
    .price-row .price{margin:0;flex:1 1 340px;max-width:420px;text-align:left}
    .price-row .price .amt{text-align:left}
    .price small{color:var(--muted)}

    .faq{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}
    .faq details{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .faq summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .faq p{color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0}

    .final{text-align:center}
    footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:14px}
    @media(max-width:760px){.steps,.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header><div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand"><span>A</span>Video<span>Router</span></div>
    <a class="btn" href="/login">Log in</a>
  </div></header>

  <div class="wrap">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Your Zoom &amp; Fathom recordings — auto-published to YouTube <span class="hl">and into your course</span></h1>
      <p class="sub">Most tools stop at YouTube. AVideoRouter also files every recording into the right
        LMS course and module, then clears it off Zoom. Connect once, set your rules, and it runs —
        on a schedule or one click.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn primary big" href="/login">Start free — first upload's on us</a>
        <a class="btn big" href="#how">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tiny">Start free · Pay as you go · GST invoice provided</div>
    </div>

    <!-- HERO VIDEO (URL pulled live from settings) -->
    <% if (videoUrl) { %>
    <div class="video"><div class="video-frame">
      <iframe src="<%= videoUrl %>" title="VideoRouter demo" loading="lazy"
        allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; encrypted-media" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div></div>
    <% } %>

    <!-- SPEED / JAW-DROP -->
    <div class="speed">
      <div><div class="num">~90 sec</div><div class="muted">for a full 1&nbsp;GB video</div></div>
      <div style="text-align:left">
        <b>Built for 2–4&nbsp;GB class recordings.</b><br>
        <span class="muted">≈ 60 seconds to download from the source, ≈ 30 seconds to upload. And because we
        <b>stream</b> the whole file — instead of handing a URL to YouTube — the big recordings that break
        other tools go through cleanly.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PROBLEM -->
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>The after-class grind, gone</h2>
      <p class="lead">Every recording is 10–20 minutes of the same busywork: download and wait; upload to
        YouTube and set the title and privacy; file it into the right course and module; then clear it off
        Zoom before storage fills. Thirty recordings a month is <b>8–10 hours</b> of it. AVideoRouter does
        the whole chain for you.</p>
      <div class="speed" style="margin-top:28px">
        <span class="muted" style="text-align:left">Unlike general automation tools, AVideoRouter is built for exactly this job:
          it <b>streams large files</b> without choking, and it routes into your <b>LMS course</b> — not just YouTube.
          No scenario-building, no subscription to start, priced in ₹ with a GST invoice.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p class="lead">Set it up once. Then it just runs.</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><div class="n">1</div><h3>Connect</h3>
          <p>Link Zoom &amp; Fathom, your YouTube channel(s), and your LMS. One-time, secure.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="n">2</div><h3>Set rules</h3>
          <p>Map each recording to its channel, course and module — with your title and privacy defaults.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="n">3</div><h3>Relax</h3>
          <p>On a schedule or one click, every recording is routed end-to-end and logged.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Everything you need to publish at scale</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🎯</div><h3>YouTube <em>and</em> your LMS course</h3>
          <p>The difference: publish to YouTube and file straight into the right LMS course and module. Most tools stop at YouTube.</p></div>
        <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🎥</div><h3>Zoom &amp; Fathom sources</h3>
          <p>Recordings are pulled from Zoom and Fathom automatically — no manual downloads.</p></div>
        <div class="feat"><div class="ic">⚡</div><h3>Built for big files</h3>
          <p>We stream the whole file, so 2–4&nbsp;GB class recordings upload cleanly where URL-passing tools fail.</p></div>
        <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🧹</div><h3>Delete from Zoom, right here</h3>
          <p>Clear published recordings off Zoom from the dashboard — without ever signing in to Zoom.</p></div>
        <div class="feat"><div class="ic">⏱️</div><h3>Daily scheduler <small class="muted">· Always-On</small></h3>
          <p>Regular sessions? Run batches on a daily schedule, hands-free, and watch every step in the logs.</p></div>
        <div class="feat"><div class="ic">👥</div><h3>Team seats <small class="muted">· Always-On</small></h3>
          <p>Add your team with view or edit access — so simple anyone can run it.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING -->
  <section id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Simple pricing. Two ways to pay.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Start pay-as-you-go. Go Always-On when you're running regular batches.</p>
      <div class="price-row">
        <div class="price">
          <div class="amt">From ₹50 <small>/ unit</small></div>
          <p class="muted" style="margin:.3rem 0 6px">Pay as you go · first upload free</p>
          <ul>
            <% packs.forEach(function (p) { %>
            <li><b><%= p.units %> units</b> — ₹<%= (p.base / 100).toLocaleString('en-IN') %>
              <span class="muted">(₹<%= Math.round(p.ratePerUnitPaise / 100) %>/unit<%= p.bonusPaise > 0 ? ' — bigger pack, lower rate' : '' %>)</span></li>
            <% }); %>
            <li>1 unit = up to 1&nbsp;GB per file (over 1&nbsp;GB = 2 units)</li>
            <li>GST invoice on request — just add your GSTIN</li>
          </ul>
          <div><a class="btn primary big" href="/login">Start free</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="price">
          <div class="amt">₹<%= (alwaysOnPricePaise / 100).toLocaleString('en-IN') %> <small>/ month</small></div>
          <p class="muted" style="margin:.3rem 0 6px">Always-On · for regular batches</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Unlocks the daily scheduler</li>
            <li>Unlimited staff seats (view / edit)</li>
            <li>Transfers stay pay-as-you-go on top</li>
            <li>Cancel anytime — access runs to period end</li>
          </ul>
          <div><a class="btn big" href="/login">Get Always-On</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>What do I need to get started?</summary>
          <p>A Zoom (or Fathom) account, a YouTube channel, and — if you publish to a course platform —
          an LMS that exposes an API. You connect them once in the dashboard.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I have to keep the tab open?</summary>
          <p>No. Set a schedule and VideoRouter routes new recordings on its own. You can also push any recording manually with one click.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can it publish into my course platform / LMS?</summary>
          <p>Yes — that's the point. Set a rule and each recording is filed into the right LMS course and module automatically, in addition to YouTube. Your LMS needs a video-ingest API.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does it work if my recordings are 2–4&nbsp;GB?</summary>
          <p>Yes. We stream the full file to YouTube and your LMS, so large 2–4&nbsp;GB class recordings go through cleanly — where tools that just pass a URL tend to fail.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can my team help run it?</summary>
          <p>Yes, with an Always-On subscription — add staff with view or edit permissions. It's designed to be simple enough for anyone to operate.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How is it priced?</summary>
          <p>Pay as you go from ₹50 per unit of transfer (one unit = up to 1&nbsp;GB per file; larger files count as two units), dropping to ₹45 and ₹40 on bigger packs. Your first upload is free. Add your GSTIN for a GST invoice. Optional Always-On (₹999/month) unlocks the daily scheduler and unlimited staff seats; transfers stay pay-as-you-go on top.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="final">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Publish your next recording in minutes</h2>
      <p class="lead">From Zoom to YouTube <b>and into your course</b> — automatically, even at 4&nbsp;GB.
        No subscription to start. GST invoice. Done before your coffee.</p>
      <a class="btn primary big" href="/login">Start free — first upload's on us</a>
      <p style="margin-top:16px"><a href="/knowledge-base" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600">Browse the Knowledge Base →</a>
        <span style="color:var(--muted)"> — see exactly how VideoRouter removes the busywork after every live session.</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer><div class="wrap">
    <nav style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:12px">
      <a href="/faq" style="color:var(--accent)">FAQ</a>
      <a href="/privacy" style="color:var(--accent)">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms" style="color:var(--accent)">Terms</a>
      <a href="/refund" style="color:var(--accent)">Refund</a>
      <a href="/shipping" style="color:var(--accent)">Shipping</a>
      <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--accent)">Contact us</a>
    </nav>
    <div style="margin-bottom:8px">Support: <a href="mailto:connect@divineleads.guru?subject=AVideoRouter" style="color:var(--accent)">connect@divineleads.guru</a>
      — please mention <b>AVideoRouter</b> in the subject line.</div>
    <div>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> AVideoRouter · Zoom &amp; Fathom → YouTube &amp; LMS, automated ·
      an app by Divine Leads</div>
  </div></footer>
  <script src="/public/beacon.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
